---
title: Text frequencies
tags: tools
heading: "Character frequencies"
---
{% from "macros/tool.njk" import toolSection with context %}
{% set filename = page.fileSlug %}
{% set intro %}
<p class="px-2">
    For a given string of text, list out the frequencies of various character combinations. This can be useful when looking at data-driven puzzles, and trying to find recognizable patterns.
</p>
{% endset %}
{% call toolSection(intro) %}
<div class="col">
    <div class="card">
        <span class="card-label visually-hidden">Character frequencies</span>
        <div class="card-body text-center">
            <label for="{{ filename }}Text" class="visually-hidden">Characters to check</label>
            <textarea placeholder="Enter some text and click the 'Generate' button below" rows="6" id="{{ filename }}Text" class="form-control word-freqs" autocomplete="off"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="card-footer py-3">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-start align-items-center">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-md btn-convrtr" id="{{ filename }}Decode" title="Generate character frequencies">Generate</button>
                {% include "components/select-copy-dl.njk" %}
            </div>
            <hr />
            <div class="">
                <div class="grid g-4 my-1 data-to-copy active convrtr-results" id="{{ filename }}Results"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
{% endcall %}
